    "text": "A - <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>→</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></math> at 273 K. &amp; 1 atm<br /><math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> (as water expands on freezing), <math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />B - Free expansion of ideal gas.<br />q = 0<br />w = 0<br /><math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />C - Mixing of equal volume of ideal gases at constant pressure &amp; temp in an isolated container<br />q = 0, w = 0, <math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> , <math><mo>∆</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> , <math><mo>∆</mo><mi mat